.TH HTTP_POST 3
.SH NAME
http_post \- start an HTTP POST request
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <http.h>
.P
.BI "int http_post(http* " h ", const char* " location ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR http_post ()
is
.BR http_open (3)
with the method POST. The body is set with
.BR http_body (3)
or sent as chunks with
.BR http_chunked (3),
.BR http_chunk (3)
and
.BR http_chunk_end (3).
A POST without any of them is sent with "Content-Length: 0".
.SH RETURN VALUE
1 on success, 0 on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
http_open(3), http_body(3), http_chunk(3)
